{"ref":"BDB, חָדִיד","hw":"חָדִיד","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">חָדִיד</span></big>  <strong>n.pr.loc.</strong> in Benj., mentioned with <span dir=\"rtl\">לֹד</span> and <span dir=\"rtl\">אוֹנוֹ</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezra 2:33\" href=\"/Ezra.2.33\">Ezr 2:33</a> = <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 7:36\" href=\"/Nehemiah.7.36\">Ne 7:37</a>; with these and other places <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 11:34\" href=\"/Nehemiah.11.34\">Ne 11:34</a>; prob. = Ἀδιδά <a data-ref=\"The Book of Maccabees I (Kahana Translation) 12:38\" href=\"/The_Book_of_Maccabees_I_(Kahana_Translation).12.38\">1 Macc 12:38</a>, Ἀδίδοις <a data-ref=\"The Book of Maccabees I (Kahana Translation) 13:13\" href=\"/The_Book_of_Maccabees_I_(Kahana_Translation).13.13\">13:13</a>; mod. <em>El-Ḥadite</em> c. 3 1/4 miles N. of E. from Lydda, Guérin<sup>Judée i. 320</sup> (cf. Rob<sup>BR iii. 143</sup>).","next":"BDB, חָדָה","prev":"BDB, חֲדַד"}